# Build context of services/ai/Dockerfile (task 1.3, #365). The build context is the repo root (compose files,
# CI images.yml), so BuildKit reads this file, next to the Dockerfile, and not the root .dockerignore.
# Allow list: only what the Dockerfile copies is sent to the builder.
*
!services/ai/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
services/ai/.venv/
services/ai/tests/
services/ai/eval/
services/ai/prisma/
services/ai/README.md
services/ai/Dockerfile*
